568	     * Rejects an owner payload that is missing or blank in any of the required fields
569	     * (firstName, lastName, address, city, telephone). The bean-validation constraints on
570	     * {@link OwnerFieldsDto} already reject {@code null} values and most malformed input, but
571	     * a present-yet-blank {@code address} or {@code city} would otherwise slip through, so this
572	     * guard enforces the rule uniformly for every required field.
