604	    /**
605	     * Whether an existing owner has been soft-deleted. A soft-deleted owner retains its row but is
606	     * excluded from the create endpoint's duplicate and identity checks, so it never blocks the
607	     * creation of a new owner. A {@code null} flag (an owner predating the soft-delete column) is
